summary.label:
KravTrainer is the perfect app to practice your Krav Maga techniques. 
Ideal to prepare for an upcoming exam or to maintain your Krav skills!

NOTE: KravTrainer is not intended to learn Krav Maga, but to practice the known Krav techniques.

FEATURES:
* More than 300 different attacks;
* More than 10 workouts to improve your fitness;
* Save attacks to review later;
* Get notifications for saved attacks;
* Attacks with various weapons, such as knife, stick, baseball bat, handgun, assault rifle and a brick;
* Attacks for beginners and the more advanced;
* Suitable for any Krav Maga organization;
